 "moshi_text": "Hello, how is it going? I've been thinking about our team and what we can do to make it stronger. I think we need a leader, someone who can make tough decisions and guide us in the right direction. What do you think? I see your point, but we can't always rely on emotions. Sometimes we need to make tough decisions that might not be popular, but are best for the team in the long run. That's true, but we can't do that without having a clear vision for the team. We need a leader who can inspire us and lead us in the right direction. I understand what you're saying,",
